Package: shizuku-semi-auto
Version: 1.1.1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: estebanalpha
Depends: android-tools
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: Semi-automatic Shizuku activation via ADB loopback (Termux:Boot)
 Runs adb-connect and shizuku-watchdog at boot. Detects when the device is
 put into "adb tcpip" mode from a second Android device and re-activates
 Shizuku automatically, without a cable connected long-term.
